  "body": "Large coastal landholdings with an established development pathway are becoming increasingly difficult to find.\r\n\r\nApproximately 30 seconds from the private beach and boat ramp, 45 Rock Isle Road presents a rare opportunity to secure 1,788m² of freehold land in one of Torbay's most sought-after coastal locations.\r\n\r\nAdding significant value to the opportunity, Auckland Council Resource Consent has been granted for the retention of the existing dwelling and construction of two additional dwellings, creating an approved three-dwelling arrangement.*\r\n\r\nThe opportunity includes:\r\n* 1,788m² freehold landholding\r\n* Resource Consent granted for two additional dwellings*\r\n* Retain the existing home as part of the approved development\r\n* Approved works include earthworks, accessway, parking and works associated with protected trees\r\n* Residential - Mixed Housing Suburban zoning\r\n* Existing three-bedroom home offering holding, renovation or future development potential\r\n* Private beach and boat ramp approximately 30 seconds away\r\n* Close to Waiake Beach, Torbay Village and local amenities\r\n\r\nWhether you are a developer, builder, investor or extended family looking for a multi-generational living opportunity, this is a site with genuine flexibility.\r\n\r\nThe current consent provides a clear pathway to retain and renovate the existing home while constructing two additional dwellings. Alternatively, purchasers may wish to explore the site's longer-term potential and consider their own plans, subject to all necessary approvals.\r\n\r\nThe vendor originally intended to retain this substantial property for their own family's future multi-generational living, with the opportunity to accommodate multiple generations on one exceptional coastal landholding. A change in circumstances has now created the opportunity for a new owner to take advantage of the planning and groundwork already completed.\r\n\r\nA LOCATION WORTH DEVELOPING\r\n\r\nEnjoy the best of the East Coast Bays lifestyle with the private beach and boat ramp moments away, while Waiake Beach, Torbay Village, Long Bay and Browns Bay are all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nFull Resource Consent documentation, approved stamped plans and supporting property information are available for interested purchasers.\r\n\r\nA substantial landholding, a coastal lifestyle and an established development pathway - 45 Rock Isle Road is an opportunity that deserves serious consideration.\r\n\r\n*Purchasers should undertake their own independent due diligence and satisfy themselves as to the scope, conditions, currency and implementation requirements of all Resource Consents, plans and development opportunities.",
